sequenceDiagram
  %% status: reviewed
  %% command: node:converge
  %% kind: node.converge
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant SW as Swamp
  participant N as Target Node
  CLI->>GW: node:converge 12
  Note over GW: Render recorded state<br/>digest per part
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Task accepted
  SW->>N: Install the Node agent
  SW->>N: Configure the Node agent
  SW->>N: Create the orbit-env group
  SW->>N: Start the Node agent
  SW->>N: Restart the Node agent
  SW->>N: Close Instance .env files
  SW->>N: Let the agent reach homes
  opt role part drift
    SW->>N: Install Caddy
    SW->>N: Publish Caddy sites
    SW->>N: Install private DNS
    SW->>N: Configure PHP-FPM
    SW->>N: Write the tmpfiles rule
    SW->>N: Clear Route residue
    %%> Residue cleanup is best effort.
  end
  SW->>N: Check the footprint
  SW->>N: Read WireGuard state<br/>SSH argv · wg show
  alt network matches the record
    Note over N: Leave WireGuard alone
  else network drift
    SW->>N: Apply recorded network<br/>network-command child
    %%> Holds the Node and hub locks; the VPN Node publishes all recorded peers.
    SW->>N: Check the handshake<br/>bounded check
  end
  alt every required part passes
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded
    Note over GW: Record footprint digests
    GW-->>CLI: Operation succeeded
  else a required part fails
    SW--xGW: Run failed
    Note over GW: Record finished parts
    GW--xCLI: Operation failed
  end
